---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: invest(amount, tokenAllocationRate, saftSignature)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_saft: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_verify_saft --> q_check_allocation: saftSignature valid from legionSigner (proves SAFT authorization)
    q_verify_saft --> q_revert_sig: InvalidSignature
    q_check_allocation --> q_transfer: amount compliant with SAFT allocation terms
    q_check_allocation --> q_revert_allocation: SAFT compliance violation
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: bidToken.transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_cache_terms: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital += amount
    q_cache_terms --> q_update_total: cachedInvestAmount = amount, cachedTokenAllocationRate = tokenAllocationRate
    q_update_total --> q_set_refund_window: totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_set_refund_window --> q_emit: investorRefundDeadline[investor] = block.timestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Investment(investor, amount, tokenAllocationRate)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_allocation --> [*]: revert SAFTComplianceViolation

    note right of q_cache_terms
        INV-001: SAFT signature binds investor to specific allocation rate
        INV-002: each investment resets investor's individual refund window
        INV-003: cachedTokenAllocationRate uses 18 decimals precision
        INV-004: refund window is per-investor, starts from last transaction
    end note
